<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to revoke the reservation under the
<legref refid="act-1974-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref> of
an area of land as part of Botany Bay National Park and to facilitate its use
for the purposes of a helicopter rescue service base; and for other
purposes.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


