<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_2578b328-678d-4e9e-9c84-c8bc33320100"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref refid="act-2004-027"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Botany Bay
National Park (Helicopter Base Relocation) Act
2004</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6e813e1a-cc84-49d3-8bfd-51d1a7db1572"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_d397b973-cd71-4f57-9cd4-b06c61186ccc"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day or days to be
appointed by proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_77bcd9fc-3f2a-48bf-8f4b-1f5e1381e975"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_781790ca-d92d-4dd4-8473-11a18fffd00a"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Objects of this Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The objects of this Act are:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5daf777b-26f5-4955-8180-3b140738b6d3" id="sec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to revoke the reservation under the <legref
refid="act-1974-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref> of
certain land as part of the Botany Bay National Park, being land that is
required for the purposes of a helicopter base for emergency aerial
evacuation, retrieval and rescue, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_31ee00ff-4f1e-43ec-8206-3c0b776c2b28" id="sec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to facilitate the use of that land for those
purposes.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_984ef00e-649f-4be4-8796-03975291af0e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_2a2096b9-3df6-4d9c-b319-1a1ab9f3e87d"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8e808ca6-fb21-46b4-a7b3-aaaaf7d9bb00"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_48afb991-f21a-4bd1-b8eb-9f2c3c450e27"
id="sec.4-def.helicopterfacilities"><b><i>helicopter
facilities</i></b></defterm> includes buildings and installations for the
parking, fuelling, servicing and maintenance of
helicopters.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7d148273-d4fd-458f-a009-54a1778cb5fa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Words and expressions used in this Act have the
same meanings in this Act (other than in section 11) as they have in the
<legref refid="act-1979-203" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Environmental Planning and Assessment Act
1979</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_28ea4667-2e69-4924-b8c8-c8e84e93b1c4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_713ca7cd-90fd-4279-b04c-d09ceab8584f"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Land to which this Act applies</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act applies to the land shown by
cross-hatching on the survey plan that is entitled &#8220;PLAN OF PART LOT
5209 DP 704508&#8221;, identified as Plan No P572703&#8211;L1, dated 13.11.03
and deposited in the head office of the Department of
Lands.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_40358349-7ec7-4f9c-9fb5-98bb5f040ac5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_2e2795fb-3a36-4f33-aa38-2372f4d9c447"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Revocation of land as national park</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The reservation under the <legref
refid="act-1974-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref> of
the land to which this Act applies as part of Botany Bay National Park is
revoked.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b70a5b88-a30a-47a1-a839-eb3d61abb7d5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_73943f62-3139-4eb9-90f9-d41bbbb5cc56"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Application of <legref refid="act-2016-058" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land Management Act
2016</i></name></legref></b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_493759d8-5d56-4722-912c-57f524803bac"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any land to which this Act applies that was Crown
land immediately before the repeal day continues, on and from that repeal day,
to be Crown land under the <legref refid="act-2016-058" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land Management Act
2016</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_39ca5b9b-3c96-4115-b09a-da071fe65911"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_a04be2af-ef96-471e-97f0-fd4f40a65fde"
id="sec.7-def.repealday"><b><i>repeal day</i></b></defterm> means the day on
which the <legref refid="act-1989-006" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Lands Act
1989</i></name></legref> is repealed by the <legref refid="act-2016-058"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land
Management Act 2016</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 7:</b> Subst 2017 No
17, Sch 4.8.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_02480ada-5ecc-4496-b0ac-e816c8face53"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_722bb891-4e7d-46e3-8278-fd4e3b8514fa"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Application of environmental planning
instruments</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An environmental planning instrument cannot
prohibit, require development consent for, or otherwise restrict, the
development of land to which this Act applies for the purposes of the
following:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6a6b8bca-8b74-4432-b571-0b3e67c8d813" id="sec.8-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the taking off, landing and movement of
helicopters used for emergency evacuation, retrieval or
rescue,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e506a314-f1d6-45b7-ad70-46097f9e6c6b" id="sec.8-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">helicopter facilities for those
helicopters,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_93e08c77-dfa0-4d1f-90ce-1dc358e58b64" id="sec.8-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">accommodation for the crew of those helicopters,
including pilots, medical practitioners, nurses and paramedical
workers.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_802e1b05-cecd-48ce-87d0-23ceff92e089"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_91b680c3-b4e7-420f-8db1-16d1d630029c"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Application of section 36 of <legref refid="act-1983-042"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Aboriginal
Land Rights Act 1983</i></name></legref></b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the avoidance of doubt, the carrying out of
the following, on land to which this Act applies, is taken to be an essential
public purpose for the purposes of section 36 of the <legref
refid="act-1983-042" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Aboriginal Land Rights Act 1983</i></name></legref>:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_809343af-ce15-4399-9c1d-4202fbc6fab3" id="sec.9-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">development for the purposes of the taking off,
landing and movement of helicopters used for emergency evacuation, retrieval
or rescue,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a5071644-9e14-4967-90c4-097693a093ef" id="sec.9-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">development for the purposes of helicopter
facilities for those helicopters,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_87eef35f-0b86-498c-9eb6-17ab49e1a966" id="sec.9-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">development for the purposes of accommodation for
the crew of those helicopters, including pilots, medical practitioners, nurses
and paramedical workers.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_323f250f-2389-41d8-b8bc-e117a29885d8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_0595f06d-bf71-48d4-8d73-44db0262aaff"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Minister administering <legref refid="act-1974-080"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks
and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref> may grant easement or right of
way</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purpose of enabling access or the
provision of services to land to which this Act applies and despite any other
Act or law, the Minister administering the <legref refid="act-1974-080"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks
and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref> may, on such terms and conditions as
that Minister thinks fit, grant an easement or right of way under section 153
of that Act over land reserved under that Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_195f6b6e-8a24-46e5-932a-2630ad40bb4f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_5152d4ce-f3a9-4860-8be6-e6800d124074"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Saving of native title rights and
interests</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c4f0d985-2eee-4116-ad9b-0b5b0761dd9c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act does not operate to extinguish any
native title rights and interests existing in relation to the land to which
this Act applies immediately before its vesting by section
7.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_43bb0e30-7584-44d9-9777-83a2904811eb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section does not affect any extinguishment
of native title rights and interests by the operation of the <legref
jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Native Title
Act 1993</i></name></legref> of the Commonwealth or the <legref
refid="act-1994-045" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Native Title (New South Wales) Act
1994</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8692e17a-3209-45ee-b02a-26850548f057"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Words and expressions used in this section have
the same meanings as they have in the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Native Title Act
1993</i></name></legref> of the Commonwealth.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_51d1484f-4cde-455e-b780-529efe814e5b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_1c1d47dc-fa72-489c-ade0-435618f473ae"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Act to bind Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of the Parliament of New South
Wales permits, the Crown in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ddb10e88-1e8d-4ef0-be44-b314e65739a9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading guid="_05e45748-77c0-43d8-b9fd-c553d0edd009"
id="sec.13-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2be00968-5e8d-4234-a523-0a882b20c28c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bfd0cd58-2fdd-4319-b98e-cc505d7ba0c2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may contain provisions of a
savings or transitional nature consequent on the enactment of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8010baa9-c52c-4ced-8037-de61f83420a3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any such provision may, if the regulations so
provide, take effect from the date of commencement of this Act or a later
date.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c33f7251-42db-4689-b464-04ea62c54b00"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">To the extent to which any such provision takes
effect from a date that is earlier than the date of its publication in the
Gazette, the provision does not operate so as:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1e5b14d6-d31e-47f4-8070-5a7ca743ded0" id="sec.13-ssec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to affect, in a manner prejudicial to any person
(other than the State or an authority of the State), the rights of that person
existing before the date of its publication, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_72ab7b4a-f34e-4633-bbee-a6e6cb7b4ff2" id="sec.13-ssec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to impose liabilities on any person (other than
the State or an authority of the State) in respect of anything done or omitted
to be done before the date of its publication.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>
</content>


